      "id": "mathematics-01-001",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "What is the average of the first 50 natural numbers?",
      "options": {
        "A": "25",
        "B": "25.5",
        "C": "26",
        "D": "50"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "Formula: (n + 1) / 2 = (50 + 1) / 2 = 51 / 2 = 25.5",
      "hash": "7685a4390d05a7a6",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "प्रथम 50 प्राकृत संख्याओं का औसत क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "25",
            "B": "25.5",
            "C": "26",
            "D": "50"
          },
          "explanation": "सूत्र: (n + 1) / 2 = (50 + 1) / 2 = 51 / 2 = 25.5"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-01-002",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "Convert the speed of 72 km/hr into m/sec.",
      "options": {
        "A": "10 m/s",
        "B": "15 m/s",
        "C": "20 m/s",
        "D": "25 m/s"
      },
      "answer": "C",
      "explanation": "72 * (5/18) = 4 * 5 = 20 m/s",
      "hash": "23cf01cef5c0bc20",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "72 किमी/घंटा की गति को मीटर/सेकंड में बदलें।",
          "options": {
            "A": "10 मी/से",
            "B": "15 मी/से",
            "C": "20 मी/से",
            "D": "25 मी/से"
          },
          "explanation": "72 * (5/18) = 4 * 5 = 20 मी/से"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-01-003",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "If an item is bought for Rs 500 and sold for Rs 600, what is the profit percentage?",
      "options": {
        "A": "10%",
        "B": "15%",
        "C": "20%",
        "D": "25%"
      },
      "answer": "C",
      "explanation": "Profit = 600 - 500 = 100. Profit % = (100/500) * 100 = 20%",
      "hash": "6366f5b3c3c2bbb1",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "यदि कोई वस्तु 500 रुपये में खरीदी जाती है और 600 रुपये में बेची जाती है, तो लाभ प्रतिशत क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "10%",
            "B": "15%",
            "C": "20%",
            "D": "25%"
          },
          "explanation": "लाभ = 600 - 500 = 100. लाभ % = (100/500) * 100 = 20%"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-01-004",
      "number": 4,
      "question": "A and B together can do a piece of work in 15 days and B alone can do it in 20 days. In how many days can A alone do it?",
      "options": {
        "A": "30 days",
        "B": "45 days",
        "C": "60 days",
        "D": "40 days"
      },
      "answer": "C",
      "explanation": "A's work = (1/15) - (1/20) = (4 - 3) / 60 = 1/60. So, 60 days.",
      "hash": "9b6d1ee13eff5d90",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "A और B मिलकर एक कार्य को 15 दिनों में कर सकते हैं और B अकेले उसे 20 दिनों में कर सकता है। A अकेले उस कार्य को कितने दिनों में करेगा?",
          "options": {
            "A": "30 दिन",
            "B": "45 दिन",
            "C": "60 दिन",
            "D": "40 दिन"
          },
          "explanation": "A का कार्य = (1/15) - (1/20) = (4 - 3) / 60 = 1/60. इसलिए, 60 दिन।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-01-005",
      "number": 5,
      "question": "What is the third proportional to 12 and 30?",
      "options": {
        "A": "70",
        "B": "75",
        "C": "80",
        "D": "60"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "If a:b :: b:c, then c = (b*b)/a = (30*30)/12 = 900/12 = 75",
      "hash": "da66858ffa77fe6a",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "12 और 30 का तृतीय समानुपाती (third proportional) क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "70",
            "B": "75",
            "C": "80",
            "D": "60"
          },
          "explanation": "यदि a:b :: b:c, तो c = (b*b)/a = (30*30)/12 = 900/12 = 75"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-01-006",
      "number": 6,
      "question": "The length and breadth of a rectangle are 10 cm and 8 cm respectively. What is its area?",
      "options": {
        "A": "18 sq cm",
        "B": "40 sq cm",
        "C": "80 sq cm",
        "D": "36 sq cm"
      },
      "answer": "C",
      "explanation": "Area = Length × Breadth = 10 × 8 = 80 sq cm",
      "hash": "ed03d0d88209fbaf",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "एक आयत की लंबाई और चौड़ाई क्रमशः 10 सेमी और 8 सेमी है। इसका क्षेत्रफल क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "18 वर्ग सेमी",
            "B": "40 वर्ग सेमी",
            "C": "80 वर्ग सेमी",
            "D": "36 वर्ग सेमी"
          },
          "explanation": "क्षेत्रफल = लंबाई × चौड़ाई = 10 × 8 = 80 वर्ग सेमी"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-01-007",
      "number": 7,
      "question": "Two successive discounts of 10% and 20% are equivalent to a single discount of?",
